.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1755340/extras/382040ee1d985d6b32089b093cbd65dd.avif?t=1750430781\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1755340/extras/5996fd404553b8c66bd30929f1901fea.avif?t=1750430781\" /></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1755340/extras/953706538977be66916908535fbb5328.avif?t=1750430781\" /></div><br><br>The mechanics of this game are based on the techniques used to help Alzheimer\u2019s patients alleviate the symptoms of the disease.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Post-it notes help Henry to recognize items and remember how to use them.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1755340/extras/251ad1dc8b2de88d15cd33d06bd20331.poster.avif?t=1750430781\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1755340/extras/251ad1dc8b2de88d15cd33d06bd20331.webm?t=1750430781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1755340/extras/251ad1dc8b2de88d15cd33d06bd20331.mp4?t=1750430781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Tangram puzzles stimulate Henry's memory and unlock important recollections of his life with Enid.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1755340/extras/3e0f42da4669926780a72b60484a7524.poster.avif?t=1750430781\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1755340/extras/3e0f42da4669926780a72b60484a7524.webm?t=1750430781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item